<title>USA: Imperial Petroleum names president.</title>
<headline>Imperial Petroleum names president.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Petroleum Recovery Corp said it appointed Larry Taylor as president.</p>
<p>Taylor is a co-founder of Imperial, and has served as executive vice president since 1995.</p>
<p>Barry Meuse resigned as president and chief executive of the company to devote more time to his role as president and CEO of National Security Analysis, which is wholly owned by Imperial.</p>
</text>
